{"id":"steam-1188960","steam":1188960,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Send & Defend","summary":"Send & Defend is a competitive multiplayer tower defense game. Carve your own maze, build towers and send creeps to grow your income. Watch your rivals, steal their lives and be the last one standing.","about":"Send & Defend is a competitive multiplayer tower defense game inspired by Warcraft III Line Tower Wars. Carve your own maze, build towers to protect your portal and send creeps to attack your rivals. Every creep you send grows your income, so attacking and defending constantly feed into each other. Outlast the competition and be the one standing.\nFIRST PLAY SNAKE\nBefore the first creep arrives, carve your maze in a Snake-style opening. Guide your creature across the battlefield and work around random obstacles to shape the route incoming creeps will follow.\n\nSEND CREEPS\nSend creeps into rival battlefields and test their defenses. Every creep you send also increases your income for the rest of the match, so attacking directly fuels your economy.\n\nDEFEND WITH TOWERS\nPlace towers along your maze and stop incoming creeps before they reach your portal. Tower placement matters, especially once range, attack types and elemental combinations come into play.\n\nCREATE TOWERS. BUILD YOUR DECK.\nEarn tower tiles by playing and combine them in the Tower Builder to create custom towers. Save your creations, build your personal tower deck and take it into the next match.\n\nWATCH YOUR RIVALS\nSwitch to rival battlefields at any time. Check their maze, see what towers they are building and watch how your creeps perform. Then adjust your next attack.\n\nMAKE ELEMENTS REACT\nCombine different elements in the right order to trigger powerful reactions. Freeze creeps, unleash lightning or deal damage across entire groups. Because elemental effects only last for a short time, where you place your towers - and in which order - matters.\nWIN CONDITION\nEvery creep that reaches a rival portal steals one of their lives and adds it to your own. Keep your portal alive, take lives from your rivals and be the last one standing.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n\n• Competitive Multiplayer: Attack and defend at the same time.\n• Carve Your Maze: Shape the route incoming creeps must follow.\n• Send Creeps: Pressure rivals and grow your income.\n• Defend With Towers: Protect your portal along the maze you carved.\n• Tower Builder: Earn tiles, build custom towers and take them into battle.\n• Watch Your Rivals: Switch battlefields and adapt your next attack.\n• Elemental Reactions: Combine elements to trigger powerful effects.\n• Win Condition: Send creeps through rival portals, steal lives and be the last one standing.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188960/70edf550d42d38be8eefaeacd2df32930fc5fba0/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794478065","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188960/bc6cc12d0d0d27594237a8ed1626b610fd722af2/header.jpg?t=1794478065","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188960/6c9bff26375897aa6cf1758346d6612fcf4f9169/library_hero.jpg?t=1794478065","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188960/bc6cc12d0d0d27594237a8ed1626b610fd722af2/header.jpg?t=1794478065","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188960/302de93c1fdf56128400ff51815ca3a0faa84a22/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1794478065","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188960/dd150b9668a912f3653a3edef7a54bd89aadddcd/ss_dd150b9668a912f3653a3edef7a54bd89aadddcd.600x338.jpg?t=1794478065","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188960/dd150b9668a912f3653a3edef7a54bd89aadddcd/ss_dd150b9668a912f3653a3edef7a54bd89aadddcd.jpg?t=1794478065"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188960/